          "text": "## kandinskylab/kandinsky-6-0-vsr-2-0\n**Model:** `kandinskylab/kandinsky-6-0-vsr-2-0`\n\n### Pricing (per second of input video)\n| resolution | Price |\n| --- | --- |\n| 720p | $0.015, each input at most 60 seconds |\n| 1080p | $0.025, each input at most 60 seconds |\n| 2160p | $0.1, each input at most 20 seconds |\n\nEvery video input counts for its length: `inputVideo`, `inputVideoUrl` and each file of `inputVideoMultiple` and `inputVideoUrlMultiple`.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- **`inputVideo`** (combinefileinput) **(required)**\n  Input Video\n  Pass an array of URLs directly: `inputVideo: [\"https://...\", \"https://...\"]`. No upload needed.\n  At most 1 file. A run with more is refused.\n- **`resolution`** (select) **(required)** (sample: `1080p`, used only by a workflow step that leaves it out)\n  resolution\n  Options: `720p`, `1080p`, `2160p`\n\n### Usage\n\nUse `run_model` with this model:\n```json\n{ \"model\": \"kandinskylab/kandinsky-6-0-vsr-2-0\", \"params\": { ... } }\n```"
