      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## acme/image\n**Model:** `acme/image`\n\n### Pricing (per output megapixel)\nPixels are counted in blocks of 1024 x 1024 (1,048,576 pixels), and part of a block counts as a whole one: 1000 x 1050 is 2 blocks. Only the first output image is measured.\n- No `inputImage`: $0.03 for the first block of the output image, plus $0.01 for each further block. Note: First block, then each one.\n- With `inputImage`: $0.03 for the first block of the output image, plus $0.01 for each further block, plus $0.005 per block of each input image, at most 4 blocks ($0.02) per image.\n- Example: a 1440 x 1440 output with no input image is 2 blocks, so $0.04.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- **`inputImage`** (combinefileinput)\n  Images\n  Pass an array of URLs directly: `inputImage: [\"https://...\", \"https://...\"]`. No upload needed.\n  At most 4 files. A run with more is refused.\n\n### Usage\n\nUse `run_model` with this model:\n```json\n{ \"model\": \"acme/image\", \"params\": { ... } }\n```"
        }
      ],
