          "pricing": "$0.03 per run for an output image up to 1024 x 1024 pixels, plus $0.01 per further 1024 x 1024 block, plus $0.005 per 1024 x 1024 block of each input image (at most 4 blocks per image). Pixels are counted in blocks of 1024 x 1024 (1,048,576 pixels), and part of a block counts as a whole one: 1000 x 1050 is 2 blocks. Only the first output image is measured.",
